nodes.prompt:
YES path. Prior intake output:
${OUT['intake']}
Call ask_user for two short topic words. Reply with ONLY a JSON array of two strings, e.g. ["alpha","beta"]. No other text.

Loop body. Current item is ${topic}.
Write one short paragraph about ${topic}.
Gather context: ${OUT['gather']}

Loop after-branch. Summarize the YES path in two sentences.
Intake: ${OUT['intake']}
Gather: ${OUT['gather']}

NO path. Acknowledge the choice in one short sentence. Intake was:
${OUT['intake']}
This node omits agentOptions so the child inherits the session model.
